# module SSE transport

Owns JSON SSE framing, delayed termination, stalled-socket coalescing, dense
Responses sequence numbers and post-header errors for both HTTP APIs.

# invariant Ordered bounded delivery

Never pause the ACP producer. Only adjacent deltas with the same channel and, for
Responses, the same item/index identity may merge. Structural, terminal, error and
`[DONE]` frames remain separate and ordered; `endSse` waits for drain.

# invariant Surface-specific errors

Chat post-header errors use the REST envelope. Responses errors use the streaming
Error event with top-level `type`, `code`, `message`, `param`, and dense
`sequence_number`.
